{"3003640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Guns are Funs", "steam_appid": 3003640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/5682719f4a37d1328f7e14c560f31e4f.avif?t=1774874191\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns are Funs is an arcade game that combines elements of a shooter, runner, and tower destruction. Immerse yourself in the world of toy soldiers who wage fierce battles for power and influence in the room. Bright dynamic battles, unique missions, and a variety of game modes await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/308adf6f9ff2a90beeea01029ce9aaac.poster.avif?t=1774874191\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/308adf6f9ff2a90beeea01029ce9aaac.webm?t=1774874191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/308adf6f9ff2a90beeea01029ce9aaac.mp4?t=1774874191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story campaign is divided into chapters, each offering distinct missions that challenge your skills across different aspects of the game. And if you're looking for some non-stop fun without the narrative, dive into the sandbox mode — where you can explore all game elements and compete for the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/e2dbd4db438b47d400ac345ff5666295.poster.avif?t=1774874191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/e2dbd4db438b47d400ac345ff5666295.webm?t=1774874191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/e2dbd4db438b47d400ac345ff5666295.mp4?t=1774874191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your army of toys, crush your enemies' towers, and prove that even the smallest soldiers can become the greatest heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/d66ab97db8f1c3cb34b6e31ad688b2b2.poster.avif?t=1774874191\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/d66ab97db8f1c3cb34b6e31ad688b2b2.webm?t=1774874191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/d66ab97db8f1c3cb34b6e31ad688b2b2.mp4?t=1774874191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Vibrant 3d graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Exciting and funny plot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Comic cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Different game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Author's musical accompaniment</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/5682719f4a37d1328f7e14c560f31e4f.avif?t=1774874191\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns are Funs is an arcade game that combines elements of a shooter, runner, and tower destruction. Immerse yourself in the world of toy soldiers who wage fierce battles for power and influence in the room. Bright dynamic battles, unique missions, and a variety of game modes await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/308adf6f9ff2a90beeea01029ce9aaac.poster.avif?t=1774874191\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/308adf6f9ff2a90beeea01029ce9aaac.webm?t=1774874191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/308adf6f9ff2a90beeea01029ce9aaac.mp4?t=1774874191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story campaign is divided into chapters, each offering distinct missions that challenge your skills across different aspects of the game. And if you're looking for some non-stop fun without the narrative, dive into the sandbox mode — where you can explore all game elements and compete for the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/e2dbd4db438b47d400ac345ff5666295.poster.avif?t=1774874191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/e2dbd4db438b47d400ac345ff5666295.webm?t=1774874191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/e2dbd4db438b47d400ac345ff5666295.mp4?t=1774874191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your army of toys, crush your enemies' towers, and prove that even the smallest soldiers can become the greatest heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/d66ab97db8f1c3cb34b6e31ad688b2b2.poster.avif?t=1774874191\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/d66ab97db8f1c3cb34b6e31ad688b2b2.webm?t=1774874191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/d66ab97db8f1c3cb34b6e31ad688b2b2.mp4?t=1774874191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Vibrant 3d graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Exciting and funny plot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Comic cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Different game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Author's musical accompaniment</p>", "short_description": "Guns are Funs is an arcade game that combines elements of a shooter, runner, and tower destruction. Immerse yourself in the world of toy soldiers who wage fierce battles for power and influence in the room. Bright dynamic battles, unique missions, and a variety of game modes await you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/header.jpg?t=1774874191", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/eadbde80ba380a2eebe3babe783d7ba7eed221fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774874191", "ca